  <p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
  style='font-size:15.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:宋体'>二、项目实施的目的、意义</span></b><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312'><span
  lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p></td></tr> <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:1;height:110pt'>
  <td  width=616 valign=top style='width:462.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:
  none;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;
  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:110pt'><div style="font-size:medium;">
</div>
<div class="document" style="font-size:medium;">
	<div class="section">
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:11.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">项目实施的目的</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">：</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">1. 解决WSI处理中的效率瓶颈全切片病理图像（WSI）数据量巨大（单张达数百MB至数GB，分辨率可达85,000×40,000像素），而有效组织区域常不足30%，约78%的像素属于重复性背景区域，大量计算资源消耗在无效图块上。现有方法处理单张WSI平均耗时约4.2分钟，而人工分析一张复杂切片更是长达20分钟，难以满足临床高通量诊断需求。本项目旨在构建高效的预处理流水线，从源头解决处理效率低下的问题。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">2. 突破均匀采样的局限性</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">传统均匀采样易导致关键区域采样不足、冗余图块过多。本项目研究基于细胞密度和纹理复杂度的自适应非均匀采样策略，在保证诊断信息完整的前提下，将图块数量压缩30%-50%，降低后续计算成本。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">3. 构建可复用的开源工具与数据集</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">目前缺乏统一的病理图像预处理工具，造成重复劳动且结果难以复现。本项目将封装开源工具包，并输出标准化数据集，为后续研究提供高质量输入。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:11.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">项目实施的意义</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">：</span><span style="font-size:9pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">1.</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">学术价值</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">填补方法空白：针对病理图像特性设计自适应采样策略，为高效计算提供新思路</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">；</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">促进可复现研究</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">，</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">开源工具包降低入门门槛，推动领域生态建设</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">2. 应用价值</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">降低临床部署门槛：通过预处理优化减少计算资源需求，助力AI诊断在基层医院推广</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">；</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">提升诊断效率：引导模型关注高信息量区域，提升分类准确性与处理速度</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">3. 人才培养</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">项目提供完整的医工交叉科研训练，成果以代码、论文、软著形式呈现，契合创新训练项目培养目标。本项目作为创新训练项目，旨在培养学生医工交叉科研能力，提升算法设计与工程实现水平</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
	</div>
</div><p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

  </td></tr><tr style='mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes'>
  <td  width=616 style='width:462.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:
  solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
  style='font-size:15.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:宋体'>三、项目研究内容和拟解决的关键问题</span></b><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312'><span
  lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p></td></tr> <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:1;height:110pt'>
  <td  width=616 valign=top style='width:462.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:
  none;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;
  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:110pt'><div style="font-size:medium;">
</div>
<div class="document" style="font-size:medium;">
	<div class="section">
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:11.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">项目研究内容</span><span style="font-size:11.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">：</span><span style="font-size:11.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">1. 组织区域智能分割</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">利用OTSU、形态学操作与轻量级分割网络相结合，自动识别WSI中的有效组织区域，剔除背景、脂肪、空白区，为后续采样提供精准掩膜。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">2. 自适应非均匀图块采样</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">研究基于细胞密度和纹理复杂度的动态采样方法，在高信息量区域提高采样密度，低信息量区域降低采样密度，实现图块数量压缩30%-50%。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">3. 特征提取器对比与轻量化</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">对比ResNet、ViT、EfficientNet等模型在病理图块上的表征能力，探索知识蒸馏或自监督预训练方案，在保持特征质量的同时提升提取效率。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">4. 多源数据适应性：解决不同扫描设备、染色风格下的预处理鲁棒性问题</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:12.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">拟解决的关键问题</span><span style="font-size:12.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">：</span><span style="font-size:12.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">1</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">.</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">组织区域精确分割：解决脂肪、坏死区等与背景相似度高的区域难以准确区分的问题。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">2.</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">采样权重合理定义：解决如何量化细胞密度、纹理复杂度与诊断价值的关系，避免关键信息遗漏。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">3.</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">效率与表征能力平衡：解决轻量化模型表征能力有限与大模型计算成本高之间的矛盾。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">4.</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">流程通用性与可复现性：解决不同来源</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">WSI</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;color:#0F1115;background:#FFFFFF;vertical-align:baseline;">数据（染色差异、扫描设备差异）下的预处理鲁棒性问题。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
	</div>
</div><p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

  </td></tr><tr style='mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes'>
  <td  width=616 style='width:462.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:
  solid windowtext .5pt;padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt'>
  <p class=MsoNormal><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
  style='font-size:15.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:宋体'>四、项目研究与实施的基础条件</span></b><span
  style='font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:仿宋_GB2312'><span
  lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></span></span></p></td></tr> <tr style='mso-yfti-irow:1;height:110pt'>
  <td  width=616 valign=top style='width:462.0pt;border:solid windowtext 1.0pt;border-top:
  none;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;mso-border-alt:solid windowtext .5pt;
  padding:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;height:110pt'><div style="font-size:medium;">
</div>
<div class="document" style="font-size:medium;">
	<div class="section">
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;">1.</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;">硬件条件</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"> </span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;">项目团队拥有高性能计算机（配置NVIDIA GPU），可支持深度学习模型的训练与推理</span><span style="font-size:10pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;">。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;">2.</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;">软件与数据条件</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"> </span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;">团队已搭建Python、PyTorch、OpenCV等深度学习开发环境，熟悉WSI处理工具（如OpenSlide）。项目拟使用公开病理图像数据集（如TCGA、CAMELYON）开展实验，学校可协助获取相关资源。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
			<span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;">3.</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;vertical-align:baseline;">团队基础</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"> </span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;">项目成员均来自计算机与人工智能学院，具备图像处理、深度学习、软件工程等方面的课程基础与实践能力，分工明确，具备完成项目的技术储备。</span><span style="font-size:10.5pt;font-family:宋体;vertical-align:baseline;"></span>
		</p>
		<p class="paragraph text-align-type-justify" style="text-align:justify;font-family:等线;font-size:12pt;">
